#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:1022
#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:1217
msgid "Defaults"
msgstr "Domyślne"

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:1022
msgid ""
"Defaults qosify applies when a key is absent — interface: mode diffserv4, "
"ingress 1, egress 1, nat 1, host_isolate 1, autorate_ingress 0. device: "
"identical except nat 0. defaults: timeout 3600, dscp_default_tcp/udp CS0, "
"dscp_prio/dscp_bulk/dscp_icmp unset, bulk_trigger_pps/bulk_trigger_timeout/"
"prio_max_avg_pkt_len 0 (disabled)."
msgstr ""
"Domyślne wartości qosify są stosowane, gdy klucz jest nieobecny — interfejs: "
"mode diffserv4, ingress 1, egress 1, nat 1, host_isolate 1, autorate_ingress "
"0. urządzenie: identyczne, z wyjątkiem nat 0. wartości domyślne: timeout "
"3600, dscp_default_tcp/udp CS0, dscp_prio/dscp_bulk/dscp_icmp unset, "
"bulk_trigger_pps/bulk_trigger_timeout/prio_max_avg_pkt_len 0 (wyłączone)."

#: applications/luci-app-qosify/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/qosify/main.js:718
